      ?? .../VehiclePicker.Tests.swift          ?? .../VehiclePicker.Views.swift
      ?? .../VehiclePicker.strings              ?? .../VehiclePicker.swift
* Routing around the breakage is infeasible: AIFeatureCard is a shared atomic referenced by
  many other AI surfaces, so excluding the broken set cascades. Fixing the AI* files is
  outside the allowed file set for prompt 0183.

